OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will continue dry
OL,6,Fwith bright or sunny spells.
OL,7,FThickening and lowering cloud will
OL,8,Fspread east but the afternoon will
OL,9,Fremain dry. Fresh southerly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will continue
OL,12,Fcloudy and dry but patchy rain will
OL,13,Fspread to Orkney towards midnight and
OL,14,FShetland later. Rain becomes
OL,15,Fwidespread over Orkney towards morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,18,Frain becoming locally heavy from mid-
OL,19,Fmorning. The rain will clear Orkney
OL,20,Ftowards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
