OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain
OL,6,Fclears Shetland early Sunday. This
OL,7,Fwill be followed by clear or bright
OL,8,Fspells interspersed with the
OL,9,Foccasional shower Monday and Tuesday.
